{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293170","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1029317001:1":{"text":"那已经是很久之前的事了。当时特弥希娅和魔物战斗受了重伤，情况非常危急。","source_cn":"那已经是很久之前的事了。当时特弥希娅和魔物战斗受了重伤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7018B8A112127C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029317002:1":{"text":"可我却什么都做不了，只能闭着眼睛为她祈祷，祈祷艾雅的垂怜。","source_cn":"可我却什么都做不了，只能闭着眼睛为她祈祷，祈祷艾雅的垂怜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF934F8219734DAF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029317003:1":{"text":"然后，就在那个时候……我似乎听到了有人在谈论圣石。","source_cn":"然后，就在那个时候……我似乎听到了有人在谈论圣石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD059A0CE04888D41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029317004:1":{"text":"我想，这一定就是艾雅女神的指示吧。于是我决定孤注一掷，去偷了圣石。","source_cn":"我想，这一定就是艾雅女神的指示吧。于是我决定孤注一掷，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DF86EDF194018BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029317005:2":{"text":"嫌疑人阿塔兰忒，你还记得当时是谁在和你说话吗？","source_cn":"嫌疑人阿塔兰忒，你还记得当时是谁在和你说话吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96E144A9252925EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen